## Check the implementation

Test the page without the border or colour and check that the information still makes sense. Avoid stacking many inset blocks until they compete with headings.

Use the [civica accessibility checks](../accessibility/testing.html) and compare the rendered result in light and dark modes, Vivid and Muted tones, and at 320 CSS pixels. The example markup is a starting point; a theme alone does not add its application logic.

## Source and related guidance

[NHS inset text](https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/components/inset-text) informs the component choice and interaction guidance. The examples use shared GOV.UK primitives or original civica markup, Arial typography and civica assets. NHS logos and service identity are not used.

